    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5988" root="جفل" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِجْفِيلٌ</span></b>  <i>Cowardly,</i> or <i>a coward,</i> (S, K, TA,)
<i>that is frightened at everything.</i> (TA.) A heostrich (S, K) <i>that takes fright,</i> (K,) <i>and flees
from everything</i> (S, K, TA) <i>that he sees;</i> (TA;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفْلٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A bow of which the arrow
goes far.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَفُولٌ</span>.

